{"articleNo":"85278","sourceUrl":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_03.do?mode=view&articleNo=85278&article.offset=0&articleLimit=10","title":"구미지역 통학버스 운행시간(방학중) 조정 안내","writer":"국립금오공과대학교","writeDate":"2013.06.18","hit":"4356","attachments":[{"name":"구미지역셔틀버스(2013. 6.24.).xls","href":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_03.do?mode=download&articleNo=85278&attachNo=71548"}],"contentHtml":"\n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n                \n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<!--StartFragment--><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 200%; MARGIN-TOP: 10pt; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: HCI Poppy; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조; mso-hansi-font-family: HCI Poppy\" lang=\"EN-US\"></span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-hansi-font-family: HCI Poppy; mso-ascii-font-family: HCI Poppy\">우</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-hansi-font-family: HCI Poppy; mso-ascii-font-family: HCI Poppy\">리대학교 학생 및 교직원의 등·하교 편의를 제공하기 위하여 구미</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-hansi-font-family: HCI Poppy; mso-ascii-font-family: HCI Poppy\">지역 통학버스 운행시간(방학중)을 </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-hansi-font-family: HCI Poppy; mso-ascii-font-family: HCI Poppy\">붙임과 같이 </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-hansi-font-family: HCI Poppy; mso-ascii-font-family: HCI Poppy\">조정하여 운행하니 참고하시기 바랍니다.</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 200%; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: HCI Poppy; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조; mso-hansi-font-family: HCI Poppy\" lang=\"EN-US\">&nbsp; 1. 통학버스 운행 시간표 : 붙임</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 200%; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: HCI Poppy; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조; mso-hansi-font-family: HCI Poppy\" lang=\"EN-US\">&nbsp; 2. 시행기간 : </span><u style=\"text-underline: #000000 single\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: HCI Poppy; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조; mso-hansi-font-family: HCI Poppy\" lang=\"EN-US\">2013. 6. 24.(월)부터 추후 운행시간 조정시 까지</span></u></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 200%; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: HCI Poppy; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조; mso-hansi-font-family: HCI Poppy\" lang=\"EN-US\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; (단, 공휴일 및 휴무일 제외)</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 200%; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: HCI Poppy; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조; mso-hansi-font-family: HCI Poppy\" lang=\"EN-US\">&nbsp; 3. 조정사유 : 방학으로 인한 승차 인원 감소</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 200%; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: HCI Poppy; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조; mso-hansi-font-family: HCI Poppy\" lang=\"EN-US\">&nbsp; 4. 하교시 학교 출발장소 : 다목적운동장 뒤편 버스주차장</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 200%; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char\" class=\"바탕글\"></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 200%; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-hansi-font-family: HCI Poppy; mso-ascii-font-family: HCI Poppy\">붙임 구미지역 통학버스 운행노선 및 시간표 1부. 끝.</span></p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n            "}
